$clear — reset the bundle to empty arrays

SUMMARY
  Ignores all input arrays and returns a fresh empty ArrayBundle: no prompts,
  texts, images, sounds, videos, files, or pending changes.

SYNTAX
  $clear

INPUT
  Any — discarded.

OUTPUT
  Empty bundle (all arrays empty).

ARGUMENTS
  None.

BEHAVIOR
  Useful to drop accumulated state between pipeline stages or after a branch
  you do not want to carry forward.

EXAMPLE
  @scratch: @images -> $clear
  @fresh: (@a, @b) -> $clear -> @only_prompts

PROMPT-CONSUMING
  No (output has no prompts to clear).
